    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Chat Trigger\nn8n 內建的聊天介面\n\n按「Chat」按鈕開啟\n直接在 n8n 裡對話\n不需要外部工具\n\n→ 對比 Manual Trigger：\n這個是「對話」觸發\n不是「按鈕」觸發",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e8f2f8b1-dc1e-489f-85ec-8f7e4d5fbff2",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
